       fhir:ElementDefinition.short [ fhir:value "A clinical assessment performed when planning treatments and management strategies for a patient" ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "A record of a clinical assessment performed to determine what problem(s) may affect the patient and before planning the treatments or management strategies that are best to manage a patient's condition. Assessments are often 1:1 with a clinical consultation / encounter,  but this varies greatly depending on the clinical workflow. This resource is called \"ClinicalImpression\" rather than \"ClinicalAssessment\" to avoid confusion with the recording of assessment tools such as Apgar score." ] ;
